          "+class MinimalNu2Branch(nn.Module):",
          "+    \"\"\"Compact CACE-style nu=2 invariant residual features.",
          "+",
          "+    The branch intentionally stops at l<=2 Cartesian monomials and only returns",
          "+    squared/contracted atom-centered invariants.  It reuses the existing edge",
